# Committed defaults for the prod environment, baked into the prod image by
# "composer dump-env prod". NEVER PUT A SECRET HERE: APP_SECRET,
# MERCURE_JWT_SECRET, POSTGRES_PASSWORD and DATABASE_URL go in .env.local on
